'''{{FULLBASEPAGENAME}}''' is a [[notable passive skill]]. It can only appear when placing [[cluster jewel]]s into the player character's skill tree.

It only spawns from a {{il|Large Cluster Jewel}} with the [[enchantment]] {{c|enchanted|Added Small Passive Skills grant: 12% increased Lightning Damage}} or {{c|enchanted|Added Small Passive Skills grant: 12% increased Cold Damage}}.
